[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The Rust runtime sets `SIGPIPE` to `SIG_IGN` before `main` runs. A write to a
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m closed stdout therefore returns `EPIPE`, which every write site in `main.rs`
